  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a1319c17adbf8c73e9f6eaa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的评价也扶摇直上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "843be21c5d61e9058ae85bbfe7f6d40dc0c736e2763f0d2d2f039dd23055bec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "13200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:474fb28481b03b899717112c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已经备受瞩目的她，究竟还会站上多高的地方呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed37972978e674b5b94b98fa43ecd1d9643e51e4efcd5b5c78becb93bd5a9ce8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "13201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7da18f6968a8a4732311551",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "让人现在就开始期待她之后的参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8898c4689fe67a8d6347549858906341519ab6acbbd8e0846c3bb43e1138346a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "13202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:657ab1b95b039c137f3e6872",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "被狂热席卷的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮竞赛。再度获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3f5cb8a701654ef79648f35d32ffd838445d0874131fb989a8d29ef90e81b5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ae781d57ffb0a732245689",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 决赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "466efd3cd9ea9c0f3b6b1a92235317a41b93cc130146106c8100b78226958558",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0e3ee81a199492d838c263d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "撼动灵魂的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮竞赛！顺利获得了第1的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58694da236ba90f038d41787c5d2e10ca28223cbe6100dbd242ed0d185d2dff8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7e70bd36e5e0384c9a5f157",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！在<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮以<bashin>胜出了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99f5dabcf54017b629b22d4806d498af831e0eb13c3ea9b4ec44c68c2a5f8762",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6617846476dfe96abcfb9324",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca1ea6b1a88452ff30fdeb931ca9a94c26169a297f81f18bc27b7bc1448b2686",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "140100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2ad8a832620c520ac783202",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "大赛中毫无败绩的「最强赛马娘」在此诞生了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a246aeb7aac348c31962614d77834639b86415a7deed93706bc0ce58add11a25",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "140200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd09c28def191ff74a6e102e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今5战4胜的状态绝佳，照这个气势下去也能彻底称霸这场竞赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec075d4d84780ac3217b8e5542d7dc215e50c33b260a31d30b29c66d3580e14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c59ceb8f2addcb6c640c06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观众们沸腾的声援宛如地表轰隆作响，诉说着她的惊人表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ed2563c8f7bcde39b4994c87fdfa8bc7fbeb7bd5016e5adaf152aea38659ab3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88260cd9a1cfd9de8af6fe99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "她一路过关斩将，想来对手们也束手无策了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa57c4ec8848a5886e7806ed18c9e081628e05511d7ecd17741cbe0e1b220c8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec76f85842532549d23af1b0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "展现出了让人一看就明白为何会有如此高胜率的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19e35614cfc343ebf5eb3c066acbadbf8919f1cbe29544f520f3208663d8300c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbd0ac2c3789756e78687d13",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可别错过大赛中超级备受瞩目的选手接下来的竞赛……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "443a9deef2b24e58b619f1bd384766bdcdcb39786c7f5ce7936efe55122cda1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de647ac5d4fb76b91477f3e7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "甚至还听见说她会获胜简直是理所当然的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "857cd92fc2b453507e1d90b866d03df93388d8ee493927df149dd2f7906bec57",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdac53709d448df5042efe70",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "会出现能够战胜眼前这名赛马娘的对手吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e078cd56f4fd8bc369ec4b63e098827bb6c47d5cb1b0434776763a57642835e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "14202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc84f2877f1817cafccfa7d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>「<username>」</color>的得力好手<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>再度于<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 中获胜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af5d39fd28f5a4fb6c3303022012c608e0144c6fe0a0700540581e1af505429d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97d74e3a26c36deff8ccc24b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛况激荡的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第1轮竞赛中，<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>理所当然地拿下第1。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddd7be8bd54032f938f48f5c5ba01b24572fa45b8087b409e95f91e6ba7bd617",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4134cd790baed86993783128",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在强者集结的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 上依旧没有大爆冷门。获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68efe6e8764c278b89be9c3283c27e93fadb8a86846cd8da23d5d9878c83aa4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df70fe81e07c47d4eaa4bef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "至今的战绩为5战5胜，所向无敌的赛马娘再度获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39065383b9c9c2d91b1e5ac9f9ea1b0e4cc1a09ef7598d18b8ec50374bc97d8d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d74e6286db541c960a40ead5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "众人都预测她会获胜，而她也没有违背众人的期待拿下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908492f3e40d69e31646f07b64dc02b043d2ac5ed060318d934db4e8b9c565e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265ff0101e0f7f1d8109da37",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从起跑开始就展现足以震撼会场般疾风怒涛的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ee69d22068f74bce979e15593bbe9f735b9ecdd5bf638ac5c4150ac65f2e5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82b9cd3d28efa13f6f589883",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好强、好强、太强了。等不及想看她的下一场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb6c1867cba8636a9b6fb32d66c64f8719a2ec3c794f01cb12163facd352ea09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c52cc2c5803c5451e85b03",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是打破以往认知的最强选手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06eed2119d357e71210a472106e905af54bdf45f58fd8c03d8af20bef59ad872",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e25ecd55354d89efcd75faf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为大赛的主角，想必连在决赛也会居高临下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a78cf47b7d876d9252bfc452e64b20cf8d84e9ef66dbd8576160ae3d4fb86b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "15202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a979658e0a7527964009e379",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即使是初次出赛，依旧展现了精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d9369f93a301dc654202a29bec9ed36755e120d07cfe2fdaec772e03209f4b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0a261dbe112dafaea3192de",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于热闹的<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 中漂亮地摘下了重大胜利的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fef315d6a0a75cf8121a34d412a3f8fa5fcb3bd2968e4d4d325e7ad9b735372",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "2000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a99e7783880aa833f52897fa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，逼退众多强者拿下第1的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16a7207814627dc47fdc3cb74f003b861441fd6d6c741f68a8a9b352b3fd2c34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30245bfd49e6a6c9270e5315",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，漂亮称霸这场重要竞赛的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5103a0a6c073964905be0282ac966d2faea7e9ec7170079ab84470ecb40ab3d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "230",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f935c38060f1eb44e8349d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>群英月赛</color> 第2轮，在令人屏息的赛况中漂亮获胜的是<color=#ff9900><character_name></color>！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe97845116e0775743163c32a824381f451fa4cb3452cf691c9a57c2f5d8f3f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
